        <h4>
            I believe in building resilient, observable systems that are both adaptable and efficient. Whether automating deployments or monitoring uptime and performance, I’m always seeking opportunities to improve myself and the systems I work with. I find genuine satisfaction in solving problems at scale, using tools like Ansible and Go, or whichever language best fits the organization’s environment, to streamline operations and ensure systems remain maintainable and ready for whatever comes next.
